      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 163 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "(How I Will Fulfill My Dream)"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "In order to fulfill my dreams, I have to do many things."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "First of all, I will study English everyday,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "by practicing listening and speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I will do this by going to an English Academy every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "When I grow up, I plan on going abroad"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "to study English in another country so that I can listen"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "and speak like a native speaker of English."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "If I really want to become a great interpreter,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "I need to work hard at improving English from now on."
    },
